/ActualText (Senior Front-End Developer & UI/UX Designer with 15+ years of experience delivering React-based web applications and full-cycle UI/UX design for enterprise and SME clients across the Philippines and Southeast Asia. Proven track record building responsive, interactive interfaces \(React, TypeScript, Three.js/React Three Fiber\) for high-traffic brands including Solaire Resort and San Miguel Corporation. Combines strong front-end engineering fundamentals with hands-on brand and marketing design experience \024 able to own a project from wireframe to production deployment without handoff gaps.)
